# Icons Folder

Store custom icons and icon graphics here.

## Files Example
- `google.png` - Google logo/icon
- `icon_home.svg` - Home icon
- `icon_profile.svg` - Profile icon
- `icon_settings.svg` - Settings icon
- `icon_logout.svg` - Logout icon

## Formats Supported
- `.png` - Raster images
- `.svg` - Vector graphics (recommended for icons)

## Usage

```dart
// PNG icon
Image.asset('assets/images/icons/google.png', width: 24, height: 24)

// SVG icon (requires flutter_svg package)
SvgPicture.asset('assets/images/icons/icon_home.svg', width: 24, height: 24)
```

## Icon Size Guidelines
- Thumbnail: 24x24 - 32x32 dp
- Standard: 48x48 - 56x56 dp
- Large: 96x96 - 128x128 dp
